comparable to similarly titled measures used by other companies, due to potential differences among calculation methodologies. Thus, there can be no assurance whether (i)&nbsp;items excluded from
the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> financial measures will occur in the future or (ii)&nbsp;there will be cash costs associated with items excluded from the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> financial measures. The
