<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> financial measures to their most comparable GAAP financial measures. Investors should consider adjusted measures in addition to, and not as a substitute for, or superior to, financial performance
measures prepared in accordance with GAAP. All <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> amounts exclude certain adjustments for share-based compensation, acquired intangible amortization expense, restructuring charges (recoveries),
