(&#8220;SEC&#8221;) and to post the investor presentation on the Company&#8217;s website at <U>coherent.com/company/investor-relations/investor-presentations</U> after market close on August&nbsp;12, 2026. We also may, from time to time, post other
important information for investors on our website at <U>coherent.com/company/investor-relations</U>. We intend to use our website as a means of disclosing material, <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-public</FONT> information and for complying
with our disclosure obligations under Regulation FD. Accordingly, investors should review the Investor Relations page of our website referenced above, in addition to following the Company&#8217;s press releases, SEC filings, and public conference
calls, presentations, and webcasts. Investors and security holders are </P>
